## Products

### Search API

Search the web and extract contents from the results. Built for AI applications and agents. Use Deep Search for multi-step web search with reasoning and structured outputs for complex research tasks.

- [Search API](https://exa.ai/products/search)
- [Search documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/search/quickstart.md)
- [Deep Search](https://exa.ai/products/deep)
- [Search best practices](https://exa.ai/docs/search/best-practices.md)

### Contents API

Extract clean, LLM-ready web content from any URL, including JavaScript-rendered pages, PDFs, and complex layouts.

- [Contents API documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/contents/quickstart.md)

### Agent

Run multi-step web research, list-building, and enrichment workflows with natural-language answers, structured outputs, and citations.

- [Agent](https://exa.ai/products/agent)
- [Agent documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/agent/quickstart.md)

### Exa Connect

Connect your agents to the world's public and private data, including web analytics, private markets, company and contact data, financial data, healthcare intelligence, compliance data, and other specialized datasets from leading providers.

- [Exa Connect](https://exa.ai/connect)
- [Connect documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/agent/connect/overview.md)

### Exa Library

Structured collections searchable through the standard search call: places, people, companies, job postings, earnings calls, SEC filings, stock pages, market quotes, products, events, podcasts, Wikipedia, research papers, patents, court opinions, indicators and countries.

- [Exa Library](https://exa.ai/library)
- [People](https://exa.ai/library/person)
- [Companies](https://exa.ai/library/organization)
- [Places](https://exa.ai/library/place)
