## Use Cases

Exa powers web search and data retrieval for coding agents, research agents, GTM workflows, chatbots, voice agents, news monitoring, people search, company search, and enrichment.

- [AI assistants with live-web context](https://exa.ai/use-cases/ai-assistants)
- [GTM and enrichment](https://exa.ai/use-cases/gtm)
- [Coding agents with current docs and code search](https://exa.ai/use-cases/coding)
- [LLM grounding and web search for inference providers](https://exa.ai/use-cases/inference-providers)
- [LLM training data and RL environments](https://exa.ai/use-cases/model-training)
- [Demos](https://exa.ai/demos)

## Integrations

Use Exa with agent frameworks, SDKs, automation tools, AI assistants, and developer platforms including OpenAI, Vercel AI SDK, LangChain, CrewAI, LlamaIndex, Pydantic AI, n8n, and others.

Coding agents can also use Stripe Projects for agentic onboarding to create an Exa account, provision an API key, and sync it directly into a project.

- [Integrations directory](https://exa.ai/integrations)
- [Agentic onboarding with Stripe](https://exa.ai/docs/integrations/marketplaces/stripe-projects.md)

