## Pricing

Exa can be started for free. New accounts receive $10 in free credits every month, plus a one-time $10 bonus for completing onboarding, with no payment method required. The free tier includes access to all endpoints.

Paid API usage is pay-as-you-go, with enterprise plans available for higher limits, custom infrastructure, security requirements, and support.

- [Pricing](https://exa.ai/pricing)
- [Pricing documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/admin/pricing.md)
- [Billing](https://exa.ai/docs/admin/billing.md)
- [Rate limits](https://exa.ai/docs/admin/billing.md)

